user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なにも出さないのもまたちょっと違うのだろうけど...","ts":"1615471405.005400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ggy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5309df0e-d26c-409a-9c75-4e1d16ff031a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://hail2u.net/blog/software/git-diff---exit-code.html\u003e","ts":"1615471373.004900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Gitのdiffコマンドにある--exit-codeオプション","id":1,"title":"Gitのdiffコマンドにある--exit-codeオプション","title_link":"https://hail2u.net/blog/software/git-diff---exit-code.html","text":"npmコマンドでよく書くパターンにGitで固定のファイルをステージしてコミットするというようなものがある。なんらかの処理を行うメインコマンドのpostコマンドでよくやる。まれにその固定のファイルが更新されないこともあり、その時コミットしてしまうとcommitサブコマンドが正常に（終了コード0で）終了しない。これを避けるためにはステージされることで更新があったかどうかをチェックする必要があることになる。それはdiffサブコマンドの--exit-codeオプションを使うとうまく書くことができる。","blocks":null,"ts":1460998382,"service_name":"hail2u.net","service_icon":"https://hail2u.net/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://hail2u.net/blog/software/git-diff---exit-code.html","original_url":"https://hail2u.net/blog/software/git-diff---exit-code.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DRb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9DF6A120-F205-4CDC-8C8B-776602A998EC","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"grep系の0件も0返すようにして欲しい","ts":"1615471341.004700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bw9m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24A0C410-0425-42F5-81DE-D46FB75BD768","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これは気持ち悪いから0返すようにしたい","ts":"1615471221.004100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tq9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0469f022-d44d-4d22-9377-aeab49de6429","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"git diffの返すエラーコード妙な気がする","ts":"1615471192.003700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N0gI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04DB711C-F3BD-45B5-8CDE-9EBB2BF6410B","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"普通のlessコマンド実行とかだとならないですよね","ts":"1615471158.003400","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1615471278.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"86aC="}]},{"client_msg_id":"C184220A-6F01-41FE-A131-B09C78869857","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"delta関係ないのか、意味あるのかなこれ","ts":"1615471148.003100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FVG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7dd80cf-9268-4663-8792-494027dc2c92","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それ私も delta 関係なくなるな","ts":"1615471009.002500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VAG/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a5773c5-23b2-4709-be95-f88fa4da7486","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分の環境固有だったりするのかな","ts":"1615470738.002200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kBws"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d54b1a4-f8d8-46b1-bb52-f3fe1b9262be","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"前聞いたかもしれないんですけど、git diffでdelta使っててPAGERで末尾までいくと終了ステータスが0で、いかずにq押すと141（？）が返ってくるのってなんでなんでしょう\n```  pager = \"{                        \\\n    if [[ $COLUMNS -ge 160 ]]; then \\\n      delta --side-by-side;         \\\n    else                            \\\n      delta;                        \\\n    fi                              \\\n  }\"```\nってしてるけどよく分かってなく","ts":"1615470695.001900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zwyKN"}]}]
